{"seq":1,"slug":"inodes-metadata","title":"inode 与元数据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/file-systems-design/data-structures/inodes-metadata","wordCount":1507,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"inode-与元数据\">inode 与元数据</h1><p>一个 inode 在盘上通常只占 128 或 256 字节,却要负责把一个可能从几字节涨到几 TB 的文件完整寻址出来。这是文件系统里最优雅的一处工程:用固定大小的结构表示任意大小的对象。这一篇拆开 inode,看它到底存了哪些元数据、用什么数据结构把有限的指针字段映射成无限的文件,以及现代文件系统为什么几乎都从多级间接转向了 extent。<a href=\"../foundations/filesystem-concepts\">文件系统抽象</a> 里只把 inode 当枢纽点了一下,这里给出它的内部全貌。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>inode 的内容分两部分:<strong>元数据</strong>(描述文件的属性)与<strong>块映射</strong>(指出文件内容在盘上哪里)。名字不在其中——名字归 <a href=\"directory-structures\">目录</a> 管。一个典型 inode 的字段构成:</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  I[&quot;inode #1234&quot;] --&gt; META[&quot;元数据区&quot;]&#10;  I --&gt; MAP[&quot;块映射区&quot;]&#10;  META --&gt; MODE[&quot;类型与权限 mode&quot;]&#10;  META --&gt; OWN[&quot;uid / gid&quot;]&#10;  META --&gt; SIZE[&quot;文件大小&quot;]&#10;  META --&gt; TS[&quot;atime/mtime/ctime&quot;]&#10;  META --&gt; LNK[&quot;链接计数 nlink&quot;]&#10;  MAP --&gt; DIRECT[&quot;直接块指针&quot;]&#10;  MAP --&gt; IND[&quot;间接块指针&quot;]&#10;  MAP --&gt; EXT[&quot;或:extent 树根&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  I[\"inode #1234\"] --&gt; META[\"元数据区\"]\n  I --&gt; MAP[\"块映射区\"]\n  META --&gt; MODE[\"类型与权限 mode\"]\n  META --&gt; OWN[\"uid / gid\"]\n  META --&gt; SIZE[\"文件大小\"]\n  META --&gt; TS[\"atime/mtime/ctime\"]\n  META --&gt; LNK[\"链接计数 nlink\"]\n  MAP --&gt; DIRECT[\"直接块指针\"]\n  MAP --&gt; IND[\"间接块指针\"]\n  MAP --&gt; EXT[\"或:extent 树根\"]</pre><p>元数据字段一览:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>谁来改</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>mode</td>\n<td>文件类型 + rwx 权限位</td>\n<td><code>chmod</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>uid / gid</td>\n<td>属主与属组</td>\n<td><code>chown</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>size</td>\n<td>字节大小</td>\n<td>写入/截断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>nlink</td>\n<td>有多少目录项指向它</td>\n<td><code>link</code>/<code>unlink</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>atime</td>\n<td>最后访问时间</td>\n<td>读</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>mtime</td>\n<td>内容最后修改时间</td>\n<td>写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ctime</td>\n<td>inode 自身最后变更时间</td>\n<td>任何元数据变动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>blocks</td>\n<td>实际占用的块数</td>\n<td>分配/释放块</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意 <code>size</code> 与 <code>blocks</code> 可以不一致:一个稀疏文件(中间有大段未写入的空洞)逻辑大小很大,实际占块却很少。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多级间接-用固定字段寻址任意大文件\">多级间接:用固定字段寻址任意大文件</h2><p>经典 Unix inode 的块映射用一个巧妙的分层方案。inode 里有一组指针,大多是<strong>直接指针</strong>——直接指向数据块。但直接指针数量有限(如 12 个),只够映射小文件。再往后是间接指针:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>一级间接</strong>:指向一个&quot;全是块指针&quot;的块。</li>\n<li><strong>二级间接</strong>:指向一个&quot;全是一级间接块指针&quot;的块。</li>\n<li><strong>三级间接</strong>:再多一层。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>设块大小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>、每个指针 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 字节,则一个间接块能放 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B/p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 个指针。三级间接能寻址的总块数约为:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>B</mi><mi>p</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>B</mi><mi>p</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>B</mi><mi>p</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\max} = N_{direct} + \\frac{B}{p} + \\left(\\frac{B}{p}\\right)^2 + \\left(\\frac{B}{p}\\right)^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.604em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.654em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.9029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.604em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.654em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.9029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4096</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B = 4096</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4096</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 为例,<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1024</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B/p = 1024</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1024</span></span></span></span></span>,三级间接项贡献约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>1024</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1024^3 \\approx 10^9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">102</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个块,即约 4 TiB,足够覆盖经典需求。</p>\n<p>这套方案的妙处是<strong>小文件零额外开销、大文件按需加层</strong>:几 KiB 的文件只用直接指针,一次访问就到数据;只有大文件才付出多次间接读的代价。代价也在这:访问大文件深处的一个块,可能要先读三个间接块,放大了随机访问的 I/O。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  IN[&quot;inode&quot;] --&gt; D[&quot;12 个直接指针&quot;]&#10;  IN --&gt; S1[&quot;1 个一级间接&quot;]&#10;  IN --&gt; S2[&quot;1 个二级间接&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; DATA1[&quot;数据块&quot;]&#10;  S1 --&gt; IB1[&quot;间接块&quot;] --&gt; DATA2[&quot;数据块&quot;]&#10;  S2 --&gt; IB2[&quot;间接块&quot;] --&gt; IB3[&quot;间接块&quot;] --&gt; DATA3[&quot;数据块&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  IN[\"inode\"] --&gt; D[\"12 个直接指针\"]\n  IN --&gt; S1[\"1 个一级间接\"]\n  IN --&gt; S2[\"1 个二级间接\"]\n  D --&gt; DATA1[\"数据块\"]\n  S1 --&gt; IB1[\"间接块\"] --&gt; DATA2[\"数据块\"]\n  S2 --&gt; IB2[\"间接块\"] --&gt; IB3[\"间接块\"] --&gt; DATA3[\"数据块\"]</pre><h2 id=\"extent-从-一块一指针-到-一段一描述\">extent:从&quot;一块一指针&quot;到&quot;一段一描述&quot;</h2><p>多级间接的根本浪费在于:一个连续的大文件,本该用&quot;从第 5000 块起,连续 1 万块&quot;一句话描述,却被迫存一万个相邻的指针。extent(区段)正是为消除这种浪费而生。一个 extent 是 <code>(逻辑起始块, 物理起始块, 长度)</code> 三元组,一条就能覆盖一大段连续区间。</p>\n<p>ext4、XFS、Btrfs 都以 extent 为核心。当文件高度连续时,extent 数量极少,一个几 GiB 的连续文件可能只需个位数 extent;只有文件被打得很碎时,extent 才增多。extent 多到 inode 装不下时,就用一棵 <strong>extent 树</strong>(B+ 树)来组织,inode 里只存树根。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>寻址方式</th>\n<th>连续大文件</th>\n<th>高度碎片文件</th>\n<th>随机访问</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>多级间接</td>\n<td>指针海量,浪费</td>\n<td>同样海量</td>\n<td>多次间接读</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>extent</td>\n<td>极少几条</td>\n<td>退化为多条</td>\n<td>树查找,层浅</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>extent 的&quot;起始+长度&quot;表示和 <a href=\"free-space-management\">空闲空间管理</a> 里的空闲 extent 是同一种思想在不同对象上的应用:一个描述文件占用,一个描述磁盘空闲。延迟分配之所以能产出大 extent,动因见 <a href=\"../foundations/disk-layout\">磁盘布局与块分配</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"扩展属性与-inline-数据\">扩展属性与 inline 数据</h2><p>inode 里除了标准元数据,还能挂<strong>扩展属性</strong>(xattr):任意的 <code>名字=值</code> 键值对,用于存 ACL、SELinux 标签、文件能力等。小的 xattr 直接塞进 inode 的剩余空间,大的另开一个块存放。</p>\n<p>现代 inode 多做到 256 字节甚至更大,腾出的空间还催生了一项优化:<strong>inline 数据</strong>。当文件内容极小(几十字节)时,干脆把数据直接存进 inode 本体,连一个数据块都不分配。这对海量小文件场景(如邮件、配置)能显著省块、省一次 I/O——读 inode 时数据就跟着回来了。Btrfs、ext4(inline_data 特性)都支持这一手。</p>\n<h2 id=\"硬链接-时间戳与一致性\">硬链接、时间戳与一致性</h2><p>inode 的 <code>nlink</code> 字段是硬链接的记账核心。每多一个名字指向它,<code>nlink</code> 加一;<code>unlink</code> 减一,归零且无人打开时数据才释放——这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/filesystem-concepts\">文件系统抽象</a> 里&quot;删除正在使用的文件不丢数据&quot;的字段级解释。</p>\n<p>三个时间戳里,<code>ctime</code> 最容易被误解:它不是创建时间,而是 inode 自身的最后变更时间,改权限、改属主、加链接都会更新它。许多现代文件系统(ext4、XFS、Btrfs)额外存了真正的创建时间 <code>crtime/btime</code>。</p>\n<p>inode 的更新涉及多个字段,而且常常要和数据块、目录项、位图协同改动。一旦中途崩溃,inode 可能指向尚未写入的块,或 <code>nlink</code> 与实际目录项数对不上——这类不一致正是 <a href=\"../reliability/journaling\">日志文件系统</a> 和 <a href=\"../reliability/consistency-fsck\">一致性与崩溃恢复</a> 要解决的核心问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>inode 用固定大小(128–256+ 字节)结构表示任意大小的文件,内容分元数据与块映射两部分,<strong>不含名字</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>多级间接</strong>让小文件零开销、大文件按需加层,但大文件深处访问要多次间接读。</li>\n<li><strong>extent</strong> 用 <code>(起始, 长度)</code> 替代&quot;一块一指针&quot;,连续文件极省;extent 多了用 B+ 树(extent 树)组织,与 <a href=\"free-space-management\">空闲 extent</a> 同源。</li>\n<li><strong>扩展属性</strong>存 ACL/标签;<strong>inline 数据</strong>把极小文件直接塞进 inode,省块省 I/O。</li>\n<li><code>nlink</code> 是硬链接记账核心,解释了 <a href=\"../foundations/filesystem-concepts\">删除占用文件不丢数据</a>;<code>ctime</code> 是变更时间而非创建时间。</li>\n<li>inode 多字段协同更新的原子性问题,引出第三章的 <a href=\"../reliability/journaling\">日志</a> 与 <a href=\"../reliability/consistency-fsck\">崩溃恢复</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"inode 与元数据","id":"inode-与元数据"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"多级间接:用固定字段寻址任意大文件","id":"多级间接-用固定字段寻址任意大文件"},{"level":2,"text":"extent:从\"一块一指针\"到\"一段一描述\"","id":"extent-从-一块一指针-到-一段一描述"},{"level":2,"text":"扩展属性与 inline 数据","id":"扩展属性与-inline-数据"},{"level":2,"text":"硬链接、时间戳与一致性","id":"硬链接-时间戳与一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"虚拟文件系统层","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/file-systems-design/foundations/vfs-layer"},"next":{"title":"目录组织：线性、B 树与哈希","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/file-systems-design/data-structures/directory-structures"}}